## yosys synthesis script for gatemate_ising_n16 — workaround C: -luttree flag.
##
## Investigation history for the yosys↔nextpnr-himbaechel LUT mismatch:
##   Workaround A (-abc9): synth_gatemate in yosys 0.64 does not support -abc9.
##   Workaround B (techmap to CC_LUT4): confirmed CC_LUT4-only netlist, but
##     nextpnr-himbaechel 0.10 also rejects CC_LUT4 — it needs CC_L2T4/CC_L2T5
##     (the GateMate CPE's native tree-LUT cells, NOT CC_LUT4).
##   Workaround C (-luttree): synth_gatemate -luttree uses lut_tree_cells.genlib
##     + lut_tree_map.v to emit CC_L2T4/CC_L2T5 cells that nextpnr-himbaechel
##     actually accepts as its CPE cell representation.
##
## Usage (from repo root):
##   cd rtl && yosys gatemate_ising_n16_abc9.ys

read_verilog -sv gatemate_ising_n16.v
synth_gatemate -luttree -top gatemate_ising_n16 -nomx8 -json gatemate_ising_n16_abc9.json
